#: ../../files/version_control.rst:3
msgid "Version control"
msgstr "Versionsstyring"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:5
msgid ""
"Nextcloud supports a simple version control system for files. Whenever a "
"file is changed on the server or uploaded again by a client, Nextcloud keeps"
" the previous content as a version so you can restore it later. Versions "
"appear in the **Versions** tab on the Details sidebar, where you can restore"
" or download any earlier copy. Desktop and mobile clients do not manage the "
"version list themselves; they upload a new file and the server records the "
"version. Versions are stored under ``data/[user]/files_versions``."
msgstr ""
"Nextcloud har et enkelt versionsstyringssystem til filer. Hver gang en fil "
"ændres på serveren eller overføres igen af en klient, gemmer Nextcloud det "
"tidligere indhold som en version, så du kan gendanne den senere. Versionerne"
" vises under fanen **Versioner** i detaljepanelet, hvor du kan gendanne "
"eller hente enhver tidligere kopi. Skrivebords- og mobilklienter håndterer "
"ikke selv versionslisten; de overfører en ny fil, og serveren registrerer "
"versionen. Versionerne gemmes under ``data/[user]/files_versions``."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:13
msgid "File version history in the Details sidebar"
msgstr "Filens versionshistorik i detaljepanelet"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:16
msgid ""
"To restore a specific version of a file, click the circular arrow to the "
"right. Click on the timestamp to download it."
msgstr ""
"Klik på den runde pil til højre for at gendanne en bestemt version af en "
"fil. Klik på tidsstemplet for at hente versionen."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:19
msgid ""
"The versioning app expires old versions automatically to make sure that you "
"don't run out of space. This pattern is used to delete old versions:"
msgstr ""
"Appen Versioner lader automatisk gamle versioner udløbe, så du ikke løber "
"tør for plads. Dette mønster bruges til at slette gamle versioner:"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:23
msgid "For the first second we keep one version"
msgstr "I det første sekund beholder Nextcloud én version"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:24
msgid "For the first 10 seconds Nextcloud keeps one version every 2 seconds"
msgstr "I de første 10 sekunder beholder Nextcloud én version hvert 2. sekund"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:25
msgid "For the first minute Nextcloud keeps one version every 10 seconds"
msgstr "I det første minut beholder Nextcloud én version hvert 10. sekund"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:26
msgid "For the first hour Nextcloud keeps one version every minute"
msgstr "I den første time beholder Nextcloud én version hvert minut"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:27
msgid "For the first 24 hours Nextcloud keeps one version every hour"
msgstr "I de første 24 timer beholder Nextcloud én version hver time"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:28
msgid "For the first 30 days Nextcloud keeps one version every day"
msgstr "I de første 30 dage beholder Nextcloud én version hver dag"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:29
msgid "After the first 30 days Nextcloud keeps one version every week"
msgstr "Efter de første 30 dage beholder Nextcloud én version hver uge"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:31
msgid ""
"The versions are adjusted along this pattern every time a new version gets "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Versionerne justeres efter dette mønster, hver gang en ny version bliver "
"oprettet."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:34
msgid ""
"The version app never uses more than 50% of the user's currently available "
"free space. If the stored versions exceed this limit, Nextcloud deletes the "
"oldest versions until it meets the disk space limit again."
msgstr ""
"Appen Versioner bruger aldrig mere end 50 % af brugerens aktuelt ledige "
"plads. Hvis de gemte versioner fylder mere end det, sletter Nextcloud de "
"ældste versioner, indtil grænsen er overholdt igen."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:40
msgid "Naming a version"
msgstr "Navngivning af en version"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:42
msgid "You can give a name to a version."
msgstr "Du kan give en version et navn."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:44
msgid "Version actions menu"
msgstr "Menuen med handlinger for en version"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:47
msgid "Naming a file version"
msgstr "Navngivning af en filversion"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:50
msgid ""
"When a version has a name, it will be excluded from the automatic expiration"
" process."
msgstr ""
"Når en version har et navn, bliver den ikke slettet automatisk, når den "
"udløber."

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:53
msgid "Deleting a version"
msgstr "Sletning af en version"

#: ../../files/version_control.rst:55
msgid ""
"You can also manually delete a version without waiting for the automatic "
"expiration process."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også slette en version manuelt i stedet for at vente på, at den "
"udløber automatisk."
